Bark Responder ships third-party code and data:

- app/src/main/assets/yamnet.tflite: Google's YAMNet sound classifier, float32
  build from MediaPipe's model bucket
  (https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/audio_classifier/yamnet/float32/1/yamnet.tflite).
  YAMNet comes from tensorflow/models, research/audioset/yamnet, under the
  Apache License 2.0.
- LiteRT (com.google.ai.edge.litert), Apache License 2.0, runs the model.

Test clips and their licences are listed in app/src/androidTest/assets/README.md.
